1
00:01:06,359 --> 00:01:06,959
Dawei...

2
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,799
They say Yunding Department Store said no.

3
00:01:10,159 --> 00:01:12,079
They say our business credit is flawed.

4
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,239
The wholesalers who placed orders

5
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:15,719
all followed suit and canceled.

6
00:01:15,840 --> 00:01:17,760
If we're stuck with all these garments,

7
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,359
what will happen to our factory?

8
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,319
Uncle Dong.

9
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,079
Don't worry, everyone.

10
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:27,920
I'll handle Yunding Department Store.

11
00:01:28,239 --> 00:01:29,040
Keep shipping as usual.

12
00:01:30,359 --> 00:01:31,560
Sit down and get back to work, everyone.

13
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:33,120
It's fine. Everything's fine.

14
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:33,840
Everyone, sit down.

15
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:35,120
Back to your stations, please.

16
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:37,159
Sit down and work, everyone. It's fine.

17
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,040
Sister-in-law.

18
00:01:40,319 --> 00:01:41,120
Dawei,

19
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,640
if this inventory really doesn't sell,

20
00:01:44,239 --> 00:01:45,159
what's going to happen to the factory?

21
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,840
We'll definitely sell it.

22
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:47,640
Either way,

23
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:48,760
don't worry, Sister-in-law.

24
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,000
No matter what,

25
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,000
I will never let our family

26
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,239
end up as destitute as before.

27
00:01:53,799 --> 00:01:54,400
And Uncle Dong,

28
00:01:55,079 --> 00:01:56,560
whenever business interests are involved,

29
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:57,640
there's always a way through.

30
00:01:58,079 --> 00:01:59,640
It's all about who has better connections

31
00:01:59,680 --> 00:02:00,519
and bigger backing.

32
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,519
If worst comes to worst,

33
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,239
I'll see Yunding Department Store's boss.

34
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,439
Dawei,

35
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:07,239
You know Yunding Department Store's boss?

36
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:10,280
Sort of, I guess.

37
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,199
So this is no big deal.

38
00:02:13,719 --> 00:02:14,520
None of you need to worry.

39
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,520
That's wonderful then.

40
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:22,439
Knowing his assistant counts, right?

41
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,319
It's fine, it's fine.

42
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:25,599
Don't worry.

43
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,400
Back to work, everyone.

44
00:02:39,360 --> 00:02:40,159
Sun Yaoli.

45
00:02:40,719 --> 00:02:42,439
We were high school classmates, after all.

46
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:44,199
Jinhua Factory's letter of intent

47
00:02:44,199 --> 00:02:45,560
was clearly already approved.

48
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:47,840
Why the sudden stranglehold on us?

49
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:48,960
Oh, Su Hui.

50
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:52,280
You're just as naive as in high school.

51
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,439
In the business world,

52
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,680
things don't need so many reasons.

53
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:00,800
I put a stranglehold on him

54
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:02,360
because of you.

55
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,159
What do you mean?

56
00:03:07,439 --> 00:03:08,520
What do I mean?

57
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,439
You still don't get it?

58
00:03:10,039 --> 00:03:11,960
Since Ma Dawei's useless brother died,

59
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,479
you've not only paid their family's debts,

60
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:16,039
but also fooled around with punk Ma Dawei.

61
00:03:16,039 --> 00:03:16,960
Sun Yaoli!

62
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:19,120
Watch your filthy mouth!

63
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:20,879
Dakui was an honest man,

64
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:21,639
not useless!

65
00:03:21,879 --> 00:03:23,159
You have no right to insult him!

66
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,400
And another thing:

67
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:25,960
Dawei is my brother.

68
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,919
Our family runs an honest business.

69
00:03:27,919 --> 00:03:29,479
You have no right to gossip about us!

70
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,560
Honest and clean?

71
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,439
If that Ma Dawei were actually capable,

72
00:03:33,639 --> 00:03:35,360
would he fail to secure a mall counter,

73
00:03:35,479 --> 00:03:36,439
forcing you, a mere widow,

74
00:03:36,439 --> 00:03:37,840
to come out in public and beg me?

75
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:40,319
Su Hui,

76
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:41,800
all you have to do is nod

77
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,120
and fulfill my desire.

78
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,280
Not only will Jinhua Factory

79
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,240
won't just enter Yunding Department Store,

80
00:03:46,759 --> 00:03:48,879
I'll even give him the best retail space.

81
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,319
You make me sick!

82
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,120
Let me tell you something:

83
00:03:54,759 --> 00:03:56,360
even if our Ma family starves to death,

84
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:58,199
we'll never take your dirty scraps!

85
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:00,919
Su Hui!

86
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,840
Don't push your luck when I'm being nice!

87
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,759
I'll give you one day to think it over.

88
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:08,719
If Ma Dawei's clothes aren't in the mall,

89
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,639
that summer wear stuck in his warehouse

90
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:11,759
will completely miss the season.

91
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,719
Once his capital chain snaps,

92
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,159
we'll see if you come back begging!

93
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:40,879
Sister Yi.

94
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:43,279
You really like this dress, huh?

95
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,720
Why are you everywhere?

96
00:04:45,959 --> 00:04:46,720
What are you doing here?

97
00:04:46,839 --> 00:04:47,600
Well, our clothes

98
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,399
hit a snag with Yunding Department Store.

99
00:04:50,279 --> 00:04:51,319
I'm here to see the mall manager

100
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,199
to find out what's going on.

101
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:53,680
Perfect.

102
00:04:53,839 --> 00:04:54,879
I'm free today anyway.

103
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:56,240
I'll go up with you to check things out.

104
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,399
Sure.

105
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,720
Let's go, Sister Yi.

106
00:04:59,040 --> 00:04:59,800
Back me up!

107
00:05:11,439 --> 00:05:12,120
Manager Sun,

108
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,759
regarding Jinhua moving in,

109
00:05:18,759 --> 00:05:20,319
I think there's still room for discussion.

110
00:05:21,079 --> 00:05:22,319
Our sales figures...

111
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:23,120
Boss Ma.

112
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:26,720
I made myself very clear before.

113
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,519
Yunding Department Store is high-end.

114
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,480
When selecting brands,

115
00:05:31,639 --> 00:05:33,800
first, we look at the brand tone;

116
00:05:34,160 --> 00:05:37,040
second, the business owner's reputation.

117
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,680
As for you two points,

118
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,680
you meet neither.

119
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,759
Rules are rules.

120
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,319
You can't just walk into my office,

121
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:44,800
hang around,

122
00:05:45,079 --> 00:05:46,079
and expect them to change.

123
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,360
Now leave.

124
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:49,519
If I remember correctly,

125
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:51,279
overall department store retail data

126
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:52,480
has been declining all year.

127
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,199
And Yunding Department Store's

128
00:05:54,199 --> 00:05:56,439
new quarter's KPI focuses on foot traffic.

129
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,920
Jinhua Factory

130
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,800
can drive massive foot traffic conversion,

131
00:06:00,519 --> 00:06:02,399
exactly what the first-floor atrium needs.

132
00:06:02,399 --> 00:06:02,839
Instead of welcoming a cash cow

133
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:04,920
that brings massive profits,

134
00:06:05,079 --> 00:06:07,480
you're blabbering about vague brand tone.

135
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:08,480
Is this really

136
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,519
Yunding Department Store leasing standard?

137
00:06:11,720 --> 00:06:13,800
This rich lady knows her stuff.

138
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,839
Ma Dawei,

139
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,319
you can't even keep

140
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:18,360
your own people in line.

141
00:06:19,240 --> 00:06:19,800
Just get lost.

142
00:06:20,199 --> 00:06:20,800
Manager Sun,

143
00:06:21,279 --> 00:06:22,360
business is a battlefield.

144
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:23,560
If you put a stranglehold on me,

145
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,160
you at least need

146
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,759
a solid business reason.

147
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:29,759
Hello?

148
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:33,959
Thought it through?

149
00:06:36,199 --> 00:06:37,600
That's more like it.

150
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:38,800
Good.

151
00:06:39,959 --> 00:06:40,920
See you tonight.

152
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,519
Ma Dawei,

153
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:51,399
for your sister-in-law Su Hui's sake,

154
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:52,759
I'll make an exception for you.

155
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:55,800
That five-square-meter storage closet

156
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:56,720
next to the second-floor restroom...

157
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:58,120
I can approve it for your storefront.

158
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:58,720
How about that?

159
00:07:00,199 --> 00:07:01,040
Just now...

160
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:03,399
was that my sister-in-law on the phone?

161
00:07:07,959 --> 00:07:09,160
Sun Yaoli!

162
00:07:09,639 --> 00:07:11,000
What conditions did you demand from her?

163
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,439
If you lay a single finger on her,

164
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,399
I'll kill you!

165
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:14,959
Security!

166
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,959
Touch me and see what happens!

167
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,800
If you touch me,

168
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,279
hundreds of thousands of your garments

169
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,759
will rot in the warehouse!

170
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,759
And your sister-in-law

171
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:28,199
will have suffered for nothing!

172
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:33,639
Get out!

173
00:07:33,879 --> 00:07:35,040
Manager Sun, isn't it?

174
00:07:35,519 --> 00:07:38,079
You just preached brand tone and rules.

175
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:38,800
How is it

176
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,439
that after one phone call from a woman,

177
00:07:40,639 --> 00:07:42,160
even a storage closet by the restroom

178
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,399
can suddenly be rented out?

179
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:44,720
Manager Sun,

180
00:07:45,279 --> 00:07:46,120
is this really

181
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,399
Yunding Department Store leasing standard?

182
00:07:48,399 --> 00:07:49,839
Trading power for sex to make decisions?

183
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:51,480
Who the hell do you think you are,

184
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,519
barging in here

185
00:07:52,519 --> 00:07:53,600
to lecture me on integrity?

186
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:55,199
Ma Dawei,

187
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:56,920
I know your personal life is a mess,

188
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:58,360
but when you're out doing business,

189
00:07:58,360 --> 00:07:59,480
at least be selective with your company.

190
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,879
Some woman dragged from a nightclub,

191
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,240
thinks she can act like a big shot here?

192
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,839
Fine. Very well.

193
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:13,240
Sun Yaoli, right?

194
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:16,920
Remember what you just said.

195
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:20,319
Throw these scumbags out!

196
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,560
Let's go.

197
00:08:22,319 --> 00:08:22,720
Let's move.

198
00:08:22,839 --> 00:08:23,439
Get off me!

199
00:08:26,079 --> 00:08:26,480
Come on.

200
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,519
Sun Yaoli,

201
00:08:30,319 --> 00:08:32,000
your days are numbered!

202
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,159
Sister Yi, I'm so sorry about today.

203
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:43,960
For getting you chewed out like that.

204
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:44,919
Head back on your own first.

205
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,759
I have to rush back to the factory.

206
00:08:45,759 --> 00:08:46,879
So she doesn't do anything stupid.

207
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:47,840
I'll make it up to you another day.

208
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,720
The meeting's set for tonight.

209
00:08:49,919 --> 00:08:51,399
What's the rush? Where's the fire?

210
00:08:51,519 --> 00:08:52,720
I can't just sit around and wait!

211
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,120
Give me ten minutes.

212
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,320
I'll drive you back in a bit.

213
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,519
Ten minutes?

214
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,559
What are you going to do?

215
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:58,639
I'm going to the restroom.

216
00:08:58,639 --> 00:08:59,879
You're dead if you dare sneak off.

217
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,440
Why so fierce over a bathroom break?

218
00:09:08,879 --> 00:09:09,600
Been holding it in too long!

219
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,559
Is this the front desk?

220
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,399
Jianguo Hotel.

221
00:09:13,399 --> 00:09:14,080
Room 802.

222
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:17,360
Prepare a bouquet of champagne roses,

223
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,279
and a bottle of red wine.

224
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:19,480
Make sure the vintage is...

225
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:23,919
Mr. Chen, what brings you here?

226
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:25,279
Sun Yaoli!

227
00:09:25,639 --> 00:09:27,120
Are you blind?!

228
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,639
Th-This...

229
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:29,919
Chairman Shen!

230
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:30,960
Please, come in.

231
00:09:45,039 --> 00:09:46,360
Mr. Chen, this is...?

232
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:49,000
This is the chairman of our Yunding Group,

233
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:49,960
Chairman Shen.
